Transformer）：固定三角函数编码，无外推能力。</span></li><li fid=\"uc89bf841\" data-lake-id=\"u16960016\" id=\"u16960016\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u863c81a3\" id=\"u863c81a3\">可学习位置嵌入</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2004afd0\" id=\"u2004afd0\">（BERT/GPT）：可训练向量，但长度受限。</span></li><li fid=\"uc89bf841\" data-lake-id=\"uae01c292\" id=\"uae01c292\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5dccb0a7\" id=\"u5dccb0a7\">相对位置编码</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufb06b31a\" id=\"ufb06b31a\">（T5/DeBERTa）：关注相对距离，部分解决外推问题。</span></li><li fid=\"uc89bf841\" data-lake-id=\"u1a4c343c\" id=\"u1a4c343c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue48aa9a0\" id=\"ue48aa9a0\">旋转位置编码（RoPE）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u45d229dc\" id=\"u45d229dc\">（LLaMA/ChatGLM）：通过旋转矩阵实现相对位置编码，兼顾外推性和计算效率。 </span></li></ul><ol list=\"u6856e2cd\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"ue7c05e24\" data-lake-id=\"u67601e9d\" id=\"u67601e9d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uddceb141\" id=\"uddceb141\">案例选择</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u97b5e4bc\" id=\"u97b5e4bc\">：</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ua52c1a2e\" id=\"ua52c1a2e\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751688921177-0dba8c15-fab4-4654-9f65-6e54f0425f4e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4100e133-4b90-4d62-8ae2-172499e2eeb%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u693fb1cc-c51d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A486.4%2C%22height%22%3A234%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A56356%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A912%2C%22originHeight%22%3A439%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHATGLM%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A328%2C%22y%22%3A54%2C%22width%22%3A182%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8B%E9%99%8D%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A679%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A181%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%